#: ../../source/content-type_README.md:29
msgid ""
"Parse a `Content-Type` header. This will return an object with the "
"following properties (examples are shown for the string `'image/svg+xml; "
"charset=utf-8'`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/content-type_README.md:32
msgid ""
"`type`: The media type (the type and subtype, always lower case). "
"Example: `'image/svg+xml'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/content-type_README.md:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`parameters`: An object of the parameters in the media type (name of "
"parameter always lower case). Example: `{charset: 'utf-8'}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/content-type_README.md:38
msgid "Throws a `TypeError` if the string is missing or invalid."
msgstr ""

